  "steps": [
    "To a pan on low heat add 1.5 tbsp besan flour and roast it for 5 min. When you get a nutty smells it’s ready, now set it aside.",
    "To a bow add 230g Greek yogurt (1 cup), 1/2 tsp chillie powder, 1 tsp amchur powder, 1 tsp coriander powder, 1/2 tsp coriander powder, Add the dry roasted besan flour.",
    "Now to a pan on medium heat add 1 tbsp ghee, 1 tbsp cumin seeds, 10g thinly sliced ginger, 1 chopped onion (80g), 2 slit green chillies, 1.5 tsp salt, Sauté for 5 min.",
    "Then add 1 chopped tomato, Mix well, Add the yogurt mixture and let it cook for 5 min.",
    "Add 200g low fat panner (mash it nicely), 100ml skimmed milk, Garnish with coriander and 1 tsp Kasuri methi and it’s ready!"
  ],
